Regenerating
------------
    go generate ./internal/langconf

Re-running the generator against a newer Visual Studio Code updates both the
data and the `Extracted from` version above. If you bump it, update the version
and language count in this file too — `langconf.SourceVersion` is the checkable
copy, this one is the human-readable claim, and they are meant to agree.
